window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A <b>grumpy demon warrior</b> who doesn't want a mate.<br> A secret spy mission to a mysterious outpost.<br> One <b>pretend mating</b> to protect me from human-hating savages.<br> <b>Only one freakin' bed.</b><br> A metric ton of pheromones.<br> Wings, claws, and a <b>sneaky tail.</b><br> What can possibly go wrong?<br> Knowing my luck? Everything.<br> <br> <b>Monster’s Heart is a sci-fi alien romance with a growly hero, lots of action, and an HEA, guaranteed. This series has dystopian themes.</b></p>"; 
